{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'node --test tests/health.test.js'","aggregated_output":"TAP version 13\n# Subtest: 1. on a fresh server, /health reports an empty queue\nnot ok 1 - 1. on a fresh server, /health reports an empty queue\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 5134.278541\n  type: 'test'\n  location: '/Users/javieraldape/Projects/sf-worktrees/T-101/conformance/app/tests/health.test.js:50:1'\n  failureType: 'hookFailed'\n  error: 'server did not come up'\n  code: 'ERR_TEST_FAILURE'\n  stack: |-\n    TestContext.<anonymous> (/Users/javieraldape/Projects/sf-worktrees/T-101/conformance/app/tests/health.test.js:42:9)\n    async TestHook.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1054:7)\n  ...\n# Subtest: 2. after a job completes, /health reports queue.done incremented by 1\nnot ok 2 - 2. after a job completes, /health reports queue.done incremented by 1\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.83075\n  type: 'test'\n  location: '/Users/javieraldape/Projects/sf-worktrees/T-101/conformance/app/tests/health.test.js:57:1'\n  failureType: 'hookFailed'\n  error: 'server did not come up'\n  code: 'ERR_TEST_FAILURE'\n  stack: |-\n    TestContext.<anonymous> (/Users/javieraldape/Projects/sf-worktrees/T-101/conformance/app/tests/health.test.js:42:9)\n    async TestHook.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1054:7)\n  ...\n# Subtest: 3. after a job exhausts retries, /health reports queue.dead incremented by 1\nnot ok 3 - 3. after a job exhausts retries, /health reports queue.dead incremented by 1\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.0635\n  type: 'test'\n  location: '/Users/javieraldape/Projects/sf-worktrees/T-101/conformance/app/tests/health.test.js:67:1'\n  failureType: 'hookFailed'\n  error: 'server did not come up'\n  code: 'ERR_TEST_FAILURE'\n  stack: |-\n    TestContext.<anonymous> (/Users/javieraldape/Projects/sf-worktrees/T-101/conformance/app/tests/health.test.js:42:9)\n    async TestHook.run (node:internal/test_runner/test:1054:7)\n  ...\n1..3\n#